{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A coin with a shape of a regular hexagon of side 1 is tangent to a square of side 6, as shown in the figure.\nThe coin rotates on the perimeter of the square, until it reaches its original position.\nThe length of the line which is being inscribed by the centre of the hexagon is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f00135dece21e96a680e8e105b4d88cc2726a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{34\\pi}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 24\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{28\\pi}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 6 \\pi\\sqrt{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{None\\;of\\;these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"533\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_CyMO-30.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4b/2007_CyMO-30.PNG/200px-2007_CyMO-30.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"230\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4b/2007_CyMO-30.PNG/300px-2007_CyMO-30.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4b/2007_CyMO-30.PNG/400px-2007_CyMO-30.PNG 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each time the hexagon moves, its center travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8b7dd31c63b399cd72fe186a628adba5df3cad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of a circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Each time the hexagon goes around a corner, it's center travels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/995f44efd3d9791d3844223f8bd6b35c600050fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f0353f56c396bc697a936aa475cd889bf166f8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac5{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> of a circle.\n</p><p>The hexagon moves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times per side), and goes around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> corners.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee783858de45b972c99ae7e5e08ac26125100380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot\\frac16+4\\cdot\\frac5{12}=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/0/560db8fa60b8ad37f69f6a067c7e29a19c97bfec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(2\\cdot1\\cdot\\pi)=10\\pi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi